{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2358620/extras/af6e31a5b63d9ba3e63d2e95e21c3592.avif?t=1750707788\" width=616 height=80 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>YOUR MISSION: SPOT THE UNSEEN... BEFORE ITS TOO LATE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Spectator 2, where your sharp eyes and steely nerves are all that stand between order and chaos. Your job? Monitor live security feeds from the creepiest locations imaginable, detect anomalies, report them, and hope you're fast enough to stop reality from unraveling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2358620/extras/f6cd658256c824c9689da18b4daa4392.poster.avif?t=1750707788\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2358620/extras/f6cd658256c824c9689da18b4daa4392.webm?t=1750707788\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2358620/extras/f6cd658256c824c9689da18b4daa4392.mp4?t=1750707788\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For the first time ever, you don't have to face the fear alone! Grab a friend and dive into split-screen co-op, because two sets of eyes are better than one... or are they?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2358620/extras/efd7be167b941f6fcccc3c7ab341e3ac.avif?t=1750707788\" width=616 height=80 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MONITOR THE MADNESS</strong><br>Watch real-time security cameras across multiple eerie locations. A flickering light, a misplaced object, a shadow that wasn\u2019t there before\u2014spot and report the anomalies before it\u2019s too late<strong>.</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BRING A FRIEND (FOR MORAL SUPPORT)</strong> <br>Split-screen co-op! Because screaming is more fun together. Work as a team or panic separately\u2014either way, something is watching.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A HORROR EXPERIENCE THAT BUILDS OVER TIME</strong> <br>Subtle at first, but escalating fast, anomalies grow more disturbing the longer you survive. Stay focused, apply countermeasures, and don\u2019t let reality slip away.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2358620/extras/9b8f3014b12cc83cff12f15135933685.poster.avif?t=1750707788\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2358620/extras/9b8f3014b12cc83cff12f15135933685.webm?t=1750707788\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2358620/extras/9b8f3014b12cc83cff12f15135933685.mp4?t=1750707788\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MORE PERILOUS ANOMALIES</strong> <br>This time, anomalies are more diverse, eerie, and overwhelming than ever. From tiny shifts to full-blown intruders, your perception will be tested like never before.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2358620/extras/09f588fb79246f1ccc23962396680ff5.poster.avif?t=1750707788\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2358620/extras/09f588fb79246f1ccc23962396680ff5.webm?t=1750707788\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2358620/extras/09f588fb79246f1ccc23962396680ff5.mp4?t=1750707788\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NO TWO GAMES ARE THE SAME</strong><br>The threats? Random. Your survival? Not guaranteed. Random anomaly generation ensures every round is unpredictable.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXPLORE HAUNTINGLY BEAUTIFUL ENVIRONMENTS</strong><br>From abandoned diners to eerie hotels, every level is crafted to keep you on edge.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2358620/extras/c9b91cd701c26b5b1da7abb6e4094f69.poster.avif?t=1750707788\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2358620/extras/c9b91cd701c26b5b1da7abb6e4094f69.webm?t=1750707788\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2358620/extras/c9b91cd701c26b5b1da7abb6e4094f69.mp4?t=1750707788\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EVOLVING STORYLINE</strong> <br>Every location holds secrets. New levels unravel hidden connections in the Spectator universe. Every detail matters.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SURVIVAL ISN\u2019T GUARANTEED</strong> <br>Miss too many anomalies, and reality collapses. Keep things under control\u2026 or face something far worse than game over.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2358620/extras/12446e5a0e5c8303d39e93f7d1836727.poster.avif?t=1750707788\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2358620/extras/12446e5a0e5c8303d39e93f7d1836727.webm?t=1750707788\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2358620/extras/12446e5a0e5c8303d39e93f7d1836727.mp4?t=1750707788\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SO... YOU THINK YOU CAN WATCH?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your only weapon is your attention to detail. Your only ally? A screen full of horrors that may or may not be messing with your mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you just a Spectator\u2026 or are they watching you back?</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Easy Thing","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2358620/1578b6f8449b2ed0b5436c018b36b628ed02e802.jpg"},{"name":"Just a Short Stay","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2358620/f765ee52ebad5a6c0876b1f4947464335612ef30.jpg"},{"name":"Catch a Train","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2358620/9dc5f92d9abcd0a1abec567109b36b5e2ae05d22.jpg"},{"name":"Good Toys","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2358620/977b8dcd0b8d320ea3f02c76af58cc9e2928b5e7.jpg"},{"name":"Welcome to the Labs!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2358620/79fcb08a182e9af007450d09e169da9b46cf66b3.jpg"},{"name":"Nice Meal","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2358620/5a058fe7ec556f832fbd1ad30425acdba2a4ef9e.jpg"},{"name":"A Chilly Adventure ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2358620/d1975234527a9ed72f8c4c64737a3d007b934f81.jpg"},{"name":"Breakfast is Included","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2358620/